    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      54.67,
      571.99,
      549.18,
      595.06
    ],
    "text": "(a) Declare that the area of land called the \u201c Ancient Kondagala Raja Maha Vihara Sacred Area\u201d speci\ufb01 ed in the schedule here to shall be an urban development area for the purpose of the aforesaid ordinance; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
