  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      54.67,
      607.99,
      549.2,
      631.06
    ],
    "text": "(b) Direct that an outline physical plan shall be prepared for the \u201c Ancient Kondagala Raja Maha Vihara Sacred Area\u201d which is declared as above to be an urban development area.",
